rol in manufacturing processes, where understanding the performance of connectors under various conditions is crucial for product development and improvement."], "parameters": {"model": "nomic-embed-text"}}, "key": "embeddings_fffacb1a84b43e1ca965df62b3c27fa78a47e928129c1e0cd306d35e59d28326_v2"}